he sequence diverges."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186442204 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096796 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5986f765-9036-5124-a498-bd898119c9c5" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether a Geometric Sequence Converges Given the Nth Term"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "153959c1-4072-5c08-a7ec-83a5eb43cc97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442127} {:answer/id #uuid "91dc334f-2dd8-5d66-afe6-2cf930e63852" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $4$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442155} {:answer/id #uuid "ca569439-4e44-521b-a299-24bec0236628" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442167} {:answer/id #uuid "d4ce6817-a836-572d-b2dc-c948ada30e65" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{3}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442172} {:answer/id #uuid "ec656fda-1a80-5a5f-beb1-b506a2eb5809" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{4}{3}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442178}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "153959c1-4072-5c08-a7ec-83a5eb43cc97" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442127} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8c33f6a-af92-5717-8106-839b23d83f37" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442195}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "930eb473-5d0d-5364-be4e-fbc222527d17" :question/math-academy-id "q-141512" :question/problem "Does the sequence ${a}_{n}={(\\frac{4}{3})}^{n}$ for $n\\ge 1$ \nconverge or diverge? If it converges, what is its limit?" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have a geometric sequence with the first term ${a}_{1}$ and common ratio $r.$ Then, we have the following convergence properties:\n\n- if $|r|<1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence ${a}_{n}={(\\frac{4}{3})}^{n}$ is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=\\frac{4}{3}.$ \n\nSince $|r|>1,$ the sequence diverges."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186442198 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096744 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e4380b34-0502-552b-b94f-e121eb855f1d" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Convergence Behavior of Geometric Sequences Written Recursively"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3c1a4603-3748-5278-bda6-4ee7a2715131" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442136} {:answer/id #uuid "56604a0d-b418-5a1f-a69c-467d7353d398" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442142} {:answer/id #uuid "5d2e431f-4a17-5026-87c7-8d1a7b874ade" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $0.007$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442143} {:answer/id #uuid "70f48b0f-73e1-5598-be28-4ea95a0412d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{3}{2}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442148} {:answer/id #uuid "7132648d-f2f5-51d1-9a80-097ec950b98c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{2}{3}$" :db/id #edb/re