}^{n}$ is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=\\frac{1}{3}.$ \n\nSince $|r|<1,$ the sequence converges to $0.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186442202 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096796 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5986f765-9036-5124-a498-bd898119c9c5" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether a Geometric Sequence Converges Given the Nth Term"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05ecdca3-fcb7-5b1a-a77c-df2a4df16806" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $-\\frac{1}{4}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442121} {:answer/id #uuid "28080ad3-ed82-5c7d-8bb0-0bcb51047eea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{4}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442130} {:answer/id #uuid "39785d70-5b85-5e05-900c-2d6c11e32e31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442135} {:answer/id #uuid "52ccd38c-07a3-5300-bc3e-b4fe965d6250" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442140} {:answer/id #uuid "e23ca2e8-2498-53f3-9396-eb918f8eb895" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442175}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "39785d70-5b85-5e05-900c-2d6c11e32e31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442135} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b187301-010a-588f-b659-02825864087e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186442194}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "77ce968b-96fd-5748-918